        "original_id": "11bd1eeb-37d5-578f-b728-c551c33b6308",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Candace Flynn, Ashley Tisdale, Sara Poulsen, Dan Povenmire, Brenda Song\n- Works: Phineas and Ferb, The Suite Life of Zack & Cody, The Suite Life on Deck\n- Roles: voice actor, character creator, character designer\n\nFacts:\n- Dan Povenmire created and designed Candace Gertrude Flynn for the Disney Channel animated television series Phineas and Ferb.\n- Candace Gertrude Flynn is a main character in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Ashley Tisdale voiced Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Ashley Tisdale achieved mainstream success as Maddie Fitzpatrick in the Disney Channel series The Suite Life of Zack & Cody.\n- Sara Poulsen is best known for voicing Candace Flynn in Phineas and Ferb.\n- Sara Poulsen dubbed Brenda Song's character London Tipton in The Suite Life of Zack & Cody and The Suite Life on Deck.",
